<title>USA: Alcan cuts October ingot price by 3 cents.</title>
<headline>Alcan cuts October ingot price by 3 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Ltd said it has cut by three cents its October transaction price in the United States for ingot and extrusion billet.</p>
<p>Ingot will be 72 cents per pound, with billet at 82 cents per pound. Both prices were three cents higher in September.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
